{"slug":"j-n-hh","ar":"ج ن ح","total":34,"core":"wing; inclination; blame","forms":[{"ar":"جُنَاح","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":25,"gloss":"blame, sin","word":null,"ex":{"s":24,"a":29,"p":3,"ar":["لَّيْسَ","عَلَيْكُمْ","جُنَاحٌ","أَن","تَدْخُلُوا۟","بُيُوتًا","غَيْرَ","مَسْكُونَةٍ","فِيهَا","مَتَـٰعٌ","لَّكُمْ ۚ","وَٱللَّهُ","يَعْلَمُ","مَا","تُبْدُونَ","وَمَا","تَكْتُمُونَ"],"en":"There is no blame upon you for entering houses not inhabited in which there is convenience for you. And Allah knows what you reveal and what you conceal"}},{"ar":"جَنَاح","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":7,"gloss":"wing; side","word":null,"ex":{"s":26,"a":215,"p":2,"ar":["وَٱخْفِضْ","جَنَاحَكَ","لِمَنِ","ٱتَّبَعَكَ","مِنَ","ٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ"],"en":"And lower your wing to those who follow you of the believers"}},{"ar":"جَنَحُ","kind":"verb","form":1,"count":2,"gloss":"to incline","word":null,"ex":{"s":8,"a":61,"p":2,"ar":["وَإِن","جَنَحُوا۟","لِلسَّلْمِ","فَٱجْنَحْ","لَهَا","وَتَوَكَّلْ","عَلَى","ٱللَّهِ ۚ","إِنَّهُۥ","هُوَ","ٱلسَّمِيعُ","ٱلْعَلِيمُ"],"en":"And if they incline to peace, then incline to it [also] and rely upon Allah. Indeed, it is He who is the Hearing, the Knowing"}}],"surahs":[[2,11],[4,5],[24,4],[33,3],[8,2],[5,1],[6,1],[15,1],[17,1],[20,1],[26,1],[28,1],[35,1],[60,1]]}